<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"><title>New York Bagel Express</title><style>@media only screen and (max-width:620px){.shell{width:100%!important}.pad{padding:24px 20px!important}.h1{font-size:34px!important;line-height:1.05!important}.fl td{padding:0 4px!important}.fl img{width:88px!important;height:88px!important}}a{color:#082D5C}</style></head><body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#FFF4E2;color:#082D5C;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;">{%- assign src = 'builder' -%} {%- if customer.tags contains 'lead-dozen-deal' -%}{%- assign src = 'dozen' -%}{%- elsif customer.tags contains 'lead-free-minis' -%}{%- assign src = 'minis' -%}{%- endif -%} {%- assign base = 'https://nybagelexpress.com/products/build-your-box' -%}{%- assign tail = '' -%} {%- if src == 'dozen' -%}{%- assign base = 'https://nybagelexpress.com/pages/dozen-deal' -%}{%- assign tail = '#build' -%}{%- endif -%} {%- if src == 'minis' -%}{%- assign base = 'https://nybagelexpress.com/pages/free-minis' -%}{%- assign tail = '#build' -%}{%- endif -%} {%- if src == 'dozen' -%}{%- assign final_url = 'https://nybagelexpress.com/discount/FINAL10?redirect=%2Fpages%2Fdozen-deal' -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign final_url = 'https://nybagelexpress.com/discount/FINAL10?redirect=%2Fproducts%2Fbuild-your-box' -%}{%- endif -%} <div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;">Use FINAL10 and make your next breakfast a New York one.&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#FFF4E2;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:20px 8px;"><table role="presentation" class="shell" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:600px;max-width:100%;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;"><tr><td align="center" style="background:#082D5C;padding:22px 24px;"><a href="https://nybagelexpress.com"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0864/7989/6818/files/email-nybe-logo-reverse.png?v=1793807149" width="180" alt="New York Bagel Express" style="display:block;width:180px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;"></a></td></tr><tr><td style="background:#F47B20;height:5px;line-height:5px;font-size:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="pad" style="padding:34px 40px 22px;"><p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B9520A;">Your final follow-up</p><h1 class="h1" style="margin:0;font-size:42px;line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-1px;font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;color:#082D5C;">Make today<br>a bagel day.</h1></td></tr><tr><td><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0864/7989/6818/files/email-nybe-hero.jpg?v=1793807150&width=1200" width="600" alt="Fresh New York bagels in front of the Manhattan skyline" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;"></td></tr><tr><td class="pad" style="padding:30px 40px 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#082D5C;"><p style="margin-top:0;">Hey {{ customer.first_name | default: 'there' | escape }},</p><p>Here&rsquo;s one last reason to give us a try: take 10% off your first box with code FINAL10.</p><p>You&rsquo;ve had a look. Now it&rsquo;s time for the good part &mdash; pick your favorites and bring a New York breakfast home.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:24px 0;"><tr><td align="center" style="background:#082D5C;border-radius:16px;padding:24px 18px;color:#FFFFFF;"><div style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#F47B20;font-weight:bold;">Take 10% off today</div><div style="font-size:36px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:5px;margin:8px 0;">FINAL10</div><div style="font-size:14px;">Applied automatically with the button below.</div></td></tr></table><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:26px auto;"><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#C9420C" style="border-radius:999px;background:#C9420C;"><a href="{{ final_url }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:18px 40px;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;">Order today &amp; save 10% &rarr;</a></td></tr></table> {%- if src == 'minis' -%}<p style="font-size:14px;color:#4A5A70;">Heads up: FINAL10 can&rsquo;t be combined with the free mini bagels offer &mdash; use whichever you like better.</p>{%- endif -%}<p style="font-size:15px;margin:8px 0 4px;">This is our last reminder in this series. Your next move: breakfast.</p><p style="font-size:15px;margin:0 0 22px;">&mdash; The New York Bagel Express Team</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A5A70;margin:0 0 8px;">10% off one order with FINAL10; on subscriptions it applies to the first box. One use per customer. Can&rsquo;t be combined with other discount codes.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="background:#082D5C;padding:22px 40px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#FFFFFF;"><strong style="letter-spacing:1px;">FROM NEW YORK TO YOUR DOOR.</strong><br>We ship Monday&ndash;Wednesday from our commissary on Long Island, NY. Orders placed Wednesday&ndash;Sunday ship the following Monday.<br><a href="https://nybagelexpress.com/pages/contact" style="color:#F47B20;font-weight:bold;">Questions? We&rsquo;re here to help.</a></td></tr></table><table role="presentation" width="600" class="shell" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:600px;max-width:100%;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:20px 24px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#4A5A70;">{{ shop.name | escape }} &middot; {{ shop.address.address1 | escape }}{% if shop.address.address2 != blank %} {{ shop.address.address2 | escape }}{% endif %}, {{ shop.address.city | escape }}, {{ shop.address.province | escape }} {{ shop.address.zip | escape }}<br><span style="color:#4A5A70;">{{ unsubscribe_link }}</span>{{ open_tracking_block }}</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html> 